OL,3,GNEWSACity's Christmas market 'boring', 
OL,4,Asay visitors                           
OL,6,FVisitors to Liverpool's Christmas      
OL,7,Fmarket have criticised a lack of       
OL,8,Fvariety, with some saying there are too
OL,9,Fmany food and drink stands and not     
OL,10,Fenough opportunities to buy gifts.     
OL,12,FThe market returned to St George's     
OL,13,FPlateau this month as part of event    
OL,14,Forganiser Underbelly's new festive     
OL,15,Fattraction, Skate St George's, which   
OL,16,Falso features an ice rink, rides and   
OL,17,Flive entertainment.                    
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
