OL,3,GNEWSACity's Christmas market 'boring', 
OL,4,Asay visitors                           
OL,6,FOne visitor said the market's layout   
OL,7,Fmade it difficult for people travelling
OL,8,Ffrom Lime Street station or nearby bus 
OL,9,Fstops to access attractions including  
OL,10,FLiverpool Central Library and the World
OL,11,FMuseum.                                
OL,13,FOrganisers said it had aimed "to create
OL,14,Fsomething more than just a market" and 
OL,15,Fwould listen to feedback.              
